# Set in the host's Production environment (Vercel: Project Settings > Environment Variables).
# Enables canonical links, og:image, a Twitter card and the sitemap. Not secret.
# Must be an https origin with no path and no trailing slash. A Vercel production
# build fails if it is missing; any invalid value fails the build with a clear message.
# SITE_URL=https://www.stemagh.com

# Optional cinematic film (leave unset until the asset is supplied).
# Put the film at public/media/stemagh-story.mp4, then set and rebuild:
# SCROLL_VIDEO_SRC=/media/stemagh-story.mp4
# Optional still from the same film, at public/media/stemagh-story-poster.jpg:
# SCROLL_VIDEO_POSTER=/media/stemagh-story-poster.jpg
